---
import { getCollection } from "astro:content";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const projects = await getCollection("projects");
---

<Layout currentPage="/" showHero>
  <article class="space-y-4">
    <!-- <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight">Let’s work together</h2> -->
    <p>
      I help forward-thinking individuals, startups and enterprises to develop
      innovative digital solutions that drive business success and meet
      ambitious deadlines.
      <span class="font-medium text-tertiary"
        >My goal is to always create exceptional experiences for the right
        reasons.</span
      >
    </p>
    <p>
      You can find out more in my <a class="link" href="/about">about</a> page or take a look at my <a class="link" href="/cv">experience</a>
    </p>
  </article>
  <article class="space-y-4">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight">Some of my projects</h2>
    <p>
      I love to build things and take on new challenges. Often attempts at just
      learning something new, other times to solve problems of my own. Either
      way, they’re fun web apps and scripts that have supported in my
      understanding of the development world.
    </p>
    <p>
      I always aim to share these projects with the world as open source, and
      these are some of my favourites that I’ve built recently.
    </p>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-4 gap-y-4">
      {
        projects?.map((project) => (
          <div class="space-y-4 hover:bg-primary/5 hover:transition-none transition-colors rounded-lg p-4">
            <div class="space-y-2">
              <a href={project.data.link} target="_blank">
                <div class="link w-fit font-medium tracking-tight">
                  {project.data.title}
                </div>
              </a>
              <p class="font-mono text-tertiary text-sm">
                {project.data.stack}
              </p>
            </div>
            <p class="">{project.body}</p>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </article>
    <div class="pt-6">
      <a class="btn group" href="mailto:me@ryanharman.dev"
        >Work with me <svg
          class="inline-block group-hover:-translate-y-[2px] group-hover:translate-x-[2px] transition-transform"
          width="18"
          height="18"
          viewBox="0 0 15 15"
          fill="none"
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          ><path
            d="M3.64645 11.3536C3.45118 11.1583 3.45118 10.8417 3.64645 10.6465L10.2929 4L6 4C5.72386 4 5.5 3.77614 5.5 3.5C5.5 3.22386 5.72386 3 6 3L11.5 3C11.6326 3 11.7598 3.05268 11.8536 3.14645C11.9473 3.24022 12 3.36739 12 3.5L12 9.00001C12 9.27615 11.7761 9.50001 11.5 9.50001C11.2239 9.50001 11 9.27615 11 9.00001V4.70711L4.35355 11.3536C4.15829 11.5488 3.84171 11.5488 3.64645 11.3536Z"
            fill="currentColor"
            fill-rule="evenodd"
            clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg
        ></a
      >
    </div>
</Layout>
